<section class="bhd-page__prose-grid">
  <article class="bhd-page__prose">
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">What tends to fit</p>
    <h2>People comfortable with both ambition and unfinished systems</h2>
    <p>Startup work is rarely perfectly packaged. We value people who can ask good questions, make progress with imperfect information, document what they learn and improve the system for the next person. Strong judgment matters as much as speed, especially where science, clinical language or public trust is involved.</p>
    <p>We also expect the company to change. A role that starts narrowly may broaden as evidence, customers and partnerships grow, so clarity about priorities and willingness to collaborate across functions are important.</p>
  </article>
  <aside class="bhd-page__callout">
    <span class="bhd-page__callout-label">Interested?</span>
